WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.800
A feed post is something you can play
Recent listening uses relative time, playback controls and links to the music.

2
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:16.540
React and see the people behind it
A reaction updates its state; the reactions dialog links to real profiles.

3
00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:24.620
Move through posts at your own pace
Previous/next buttons, keyboard arrows and refresh are all available.

4
00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:32.120
Listen to what a friend is playing
Cards are derived from listening activity, including the music played during this recording.

5
